# EARTH — non-secret environment template.
#
# FORBIDDEN: do not put API keys, tokens, passwords, or private URIs in
# any VITE_* variable. Vite inlines VITE_* into the browser JavaScript bundle.
#
# This SPA (main @ 7490bda) does not read credentials. When a sovereign
# backend exists, adapter secrets (Roboflow, Tinker, Inkling, IdP, DB)
# live server-side only. Never commit real values.

